omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z84miaTDI60Q7kNvwFwqNBQ&_nc_oc=AdrzKswwbAzCvjG8MlGDB27MS7dYHs5m9-9VG0IEIGz3YrCa4xnTDmq174MJiJtazsc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afw9pGmGasILbOL4pWjzx6CmNL2pZ0EPiq4LG_PDwzT_FA&oe=69C7B9F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rHne70BI508Q7kNvwE8Okvx&_nc_oc=AdpkosOBeCcHD02DYA8M3BpvXQZZ5PlBi4L6q8uts1HxezOaAj0PtkICLoANYChKkII&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxcvWM6iuf25Z81KP4a2UXec6ZrhECe7U9aoU33UDDGqw&oe=69C7BB56"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vhOsC8jRzgEQ7kNvwGxnBqC&_nc_oc=AdoigHHtXK2FmHv_hC4GlKTcQiTlP0K4GG1hbwCpivbYFJK18JOo4csnP51OrbRgNTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwsiwxZBMtWI3h20ykqMv57kgpkedp6vR7EfFR9kHcWUg&oe=69C7D077"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://